      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Among patients with bronchial asthma, there are predominantly females who live in an industrial area. In this area, patients with severe bronchial asthma are 2.4 times more and those with a severe exacerbation are twice more. Bronchial asthma may serve as a marker of the poor environment."},
